invalid type: string "Title: Mitigating Ghost Vectors in Dense Retrieval via Idempotent Indexing\nAuthors: Duc Vu,Shunqi Liu,Yuxi Wang,Zhen Qi,Huajun Zhang\nCategories: \nSummary: Soft-deletions in vector databases leave orphaned embeddings that lead to hallucinations. This paper designs an idempotent index synchronization protocol that guarantees complete purges of outdated vector artifacts."ÿÿÿÿ